<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions - Pakistan</p>
<p>KARACHI, Dec 30 - Four general cargo vessels waiting, first waiting for six days, five fertiliser vessels waiting, first waiting for 13 days and two oil tankers waiting, first waiting for five days.</p>
</text>
